{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2026-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1767225600, "end_date": 1769903999, "month_true_total": 14, "quota": 14, "returned": 14, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:55:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "217297644", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078407338", "personaname": "Con-Air", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198078407338/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1555, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 656, "last_played": 1774719970, "avatar": "94910f47fc0fa83fc70e018595d922d74866a576"}, "language": "english", "review": "best games when i was growing up and still one of the best games i play now \r\n", "timestamp_created": 1769903265, "timestamp_updated": 1769903265, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48245614767074585", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217217300", "author": {"steamid": "76561199509053583", "personaname": "TVs Frank", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199509053583/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 4557, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 467, "last_played": 1773798030, "avatar": "a9dab48a124dc9444f769bc4e37d5a18b4fdec6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I play only for multiplayer. Really too bad that EA didn't include with Legendary Edition.", "timestamp_created": 1769826880, "timestamp_updated": 1769826880, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.681556522846221924", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "216916521", "author": {"steamid": "76561198295263717", "personaname": "Watson Prime", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/watsonprime/", "num_games_owned": 161, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 14319, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14165, "last_played": 1788379415, "avatar": "f440bf6f0f1d093ea3ebc961c707eb6f350bdeef"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm only reviewing the multiplayer, as the single-player experience in this version has fallen off a bit since the release of the Legendary Edition.\r\n\r\nMultiplayer is exclusive to this version of the game, and somehow it doesn't get boring even after hours, even though all you're doing is shooting enemies from the campaign as different characters on different maps. It's likely that the lack of monotony is due to the variety of maps, enemies, weapons, and characters, which allows for some experimentation with your build (though the variety is much less than playing as Shepard in single-player), which changes regularly, preventing boredom.\r\n\r\nThe main drawback is the terrifying grind, which can be easily overcome using methods that I will not describe here.", "timestamp_created": 1769489412, "timestamp_updated": 1769489412, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.643620014190673828", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216636796", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971769643", "personaname": "transeúnte_inocente", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971769643/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6430, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 137, "playtime_at_review": 3241, "last_played": 1791229293, "avatar": "41abfe61623f983fa603420c8302ff342348b121"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best co op multiplayer games in existence. Single player is great too. I don't like the official endings and never played them, I use the 'happy ending' mods, MEHEM or Audemus (for legendary edition). When you are set free of the official endings you can modify the whole game story to whatever suits you, as it is oftrn told through herarsay. Example: During the Thessia mission Shephard meets a small asari commando team that is then obliterated by reapers. This is the basis of assumptions about a total asari defeat/slaughter of the Thessia population. This may well be wrong and the player is free to change the story.", "timestamp_created": 1769201756, "timestamp_updated": 1769201756, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522998332977294922", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216473722", "author": {"steamid": "76561199358431419", "personaname": "soggy milk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199358431419/", "num_games_owned": 320, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 3398, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3318, "last_played": 1769008674, "avatar": "c35adeff789f8095084c494d9f2d612bef49a29e"}, "language": "english", "review": "uhhhhh \r\nthe uhhhhhhhh\r\nthe uhhhhhhhhhhhh\r\nreapers\r\nuhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh\r\nthe uhhhhhhhh\r\nedi is hot", "timestamp_created": 1769003740, "timestamp_updated": 1769003740, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474808752536773682", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216253209", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025595308", "personaname": "TheNumberL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025595308/", "num_games_owned": 183, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2401, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 457, "last_played": 1787432526, "avatar": "9162f6cd41608b479d5bfbdeef36df5091077bdb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Multiplayer still works", "timestamp_created": 1768745679, "timestamp_updated": 1768745679, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "216234256", "author": {"steamid": "76561198178978415", "personaname": "Kioho", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198178978415/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3623, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3108, "last_played": 1769001451, "avatar": "fc953539b822674e696ee931dd4712c5186bdbd6"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game itself is great.\n\nThe horribly bad EA Launcher that sometimes refuses to let the game connect to EA Servers ruins it, cause if it cannot connect, your installed DLC's won't work in SINGLE PLAYER.\n\nWhen will companies stop creating and using their own ♥♥♥♥♥♥ launch apps....", "timestamp_created": 1768726751, "timestamp_updated": 1768726751, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 24, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.725841939449310303", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 26, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "216101714", "author": {"steamid": "76561199857757221", "personaname": "WANDERPLAY", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199857757221/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 1372, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1242, "last_played": 1789116162, "avatar": "c15798436e6c406b9cd3eb5715ee876ea5271447"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mass Effect 3 is easily one of the best story-based, action-adventure, choice-driven game I’ve ever played.\r\n\r\nI have already played Mass Effect 1 and Mass Effect 2, and now playing Mass Effect 3 feels like a true continuation, not just another sequel. Every decision, relationship, and sacrifice from the previous games actually matters here, which makes the experience deeply emotional and personal.\r\n\r\nThe story is intense, mature, and powerful. It’s not just about fighting enemies — it’s about leadership, war, loss, hope, and making impossible choices. Your decisions shape conversations, characters, and outcomes, and that feeling of responsibility stays with you throughout the game.\r\n\r\nCombat is smoother and more refined compared to earlier entries, but the real strength of the game is its storytelling, characters, and atmosphere. The soundtrack, voice acting, and writing are top-tier and add so much emotional weight to every moment.\r\n\r\nWhat I love most is that this game respects the player’s journey. It rewards you for caring about characters and paying attention to choices made across the trilogy.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy:\r\n\r\n* Strong story and emotional depth\r\n* Choice-based gameplay where decisions matter\r\n* Sci-fi worlds with excellent characters\r\n* Action mixed with meaningful narrative\r\n\r\nThen Mass Effect 3 is absolutely worth playing.\r\n\r\nHighly recommended — especially if you’ve played Mass Effect 1 & 2.\r\nThis trilogy is a masterpiece, and Mass Effect 3 delivers a powerful finale.\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1768589984, "timestamp_updated": 1768589984, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215786478", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114109304", "personaname": "frelf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198114109304/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 878, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 579, "last_played": 1774483618, "avatar": "90281bcb08a9d28ef4c343c5f6b8b75f093e4a9b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Multiplayer remains absolutely amazing so many years later.", "timestamp_created": 1768174010, "timestamp_updated": 1768174010, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215532199", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079236984", "personaname": "Jack Howitzer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079236984/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1131, "last_played": 1767513201, "avatar": "ee70d8a7711d106579d3676b3589bcaabd54a94c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got almost 400 hours in multiplayer on console a decade ago, and enjoying my time now on Steam. Somehow, still a really fun PvE game mode. \"Random\" map seems heavily weighted unfortunately, but still good.", "timestamp_created": 1767928893, "timestamp_updated": 1767928893, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215529038", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096572176", "personaname": "HermesTrismegistus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198096572176/", "num_games_owned": 68, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 4195, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3593, "last_played": 1768358399, "avatar": "a182b6a8fe92b1e70d439f2522f064cdd6a3fc14"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was at the rannoch geth base when  had to get to the upper door to progress the mission, the door wont open, nothing is working, I want my money back, I cant progress further in the story line UNTIL I get the door open and there's no buttons nearby to open it.YES I even press (V) to look at the quest objective. I wrote this review after an update as of 1/8/2026", "timestamp_created": 1767924959, "timestamp_updated": 1767924959, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.464395731687545776", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215424358", "author": {"steamid": "76561199105680313", "personaname": "TRUE_NEUTRAL", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199105680313/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 955, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 249, "last_played": 1769830008, "avatar": "a72e23e